cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite the letter and the UrbanSARFloods dataset."
title: "Zero-Training SAR Flood Mapping from a Single SLC Pair: Gate Design and Its Limits"
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation of a deterministic, training-free SAR flood-mapping pipeline
  that commits a pixel as flood only after an explicit verification gate, plus the
  research scripts and result archives behind the accompanying IEEE GRSL letter.
